"The vault is a 300-foot-wide orb of adamant, reached by one guarded access point."
"The vault guardroom is a kill zone of barricades and emplaced weapons."
"The vault door is heavily warded with wizardry, alarms and anti-tamper systems."
"Behind the vault door is only a smooth wall of adamant with no visible entrance."
"Inside, the vault is a museum-like galleria of labelled plinths and cases set in a grid."
"Optically triggered Disintegration lights and adamant floor blades guard the galleria."
"Each plinth hides magical explosives that fire if its artifact is lifted without authorization."
"Years later, Nathan robs Sussu's vault."
